docker/ejbca-hsm — provenance and licensing
===========================================

This directory is not part of the kimbo11ng artifact. kimbo11ng (src/, the jar it builds) is
Apache-2.0. Everything under this directory is used only by docker/Dockerfile, to build a local
image, and is kept apart so the two licences never share a file.

